stkDock - Improved Version of the Dock that can house both Mochis and Stacked ibis trackers. It also has a fix for the tap-to-charge issue and allows for more than a few specific cables due to a better opening where the charging port is. Also has holes for clips.
stkDockBottom - It's legit just the bottom plate with clips instead of screw holes.
stkDockTank - It's an idea a friend whos travelling alot gave me. He wanted a durable case that can house the dock with the trackers in it. So this is basically a drawer to slide the Dock into (u print it upside down) that can take quite a few hits lmao.
stkDockTankEnclosure - After sliding in the Dock, the front of the case gets closed up with this press fit part.
